        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_9 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_12\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_14  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_11  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><strong>Update:\u00a0</strong>We believe the issue has been resolved but we will continue to monitor and provide any additional updates here.\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong>Update: </strong>We can see that there have been an improvement in loading times however, the issue is still being investigated and a resolution is still being worked towards.</p>\n<p><strong>Original update:</strong> We\u2019re aware of an issue impacting the network where customers may see slow loading times and difficulty streaming video content. This issue is being investigated and our vendor is working towards a resolution. We\u2019ll provide further updates here.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/speed-and-loading-issue-on-the-network/\">Speed and loading issue on the network\u00a0</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz\">Network for Learning | N4L</a>.</p>"
      }
